# Official-rules visuals on hand-made positions (tests/ui/positions/*.5dp), opened with `position`:
#   check.5dp      White's king is attacked by the rook on e8: an attack line from the rook to the king (static under Reduce motion)
#   promotion.5dp  White's pawn on e7: clicking e8 opens the promotion picker; N picks the knight
#   inactive.5dp   Timeline L+2 is inactive: dimmed and desaturated, tagged "inactive"; L0 and L+1 hold the mandatory boards
# Squares are clicked by name (`clicksq <timeline> <half-turn> <square>`), see game-standard.ui.
wait 10
position ../positions/check.5dp
wait 60
capture rules-check-attack-line
position ../positions/inactive.5dp
wait 60
capture rules-inactive-timeline
position ../positions/promotion.5dp
wait 60
clicksq 0 4 e7       # the pawn
wait 40
capture rules-promotion-selected
clicksq 0 4 e8       # its promotion square: the picker opens
wait 40
capture rules-promotion-picker
key N                # Knight
wait 60
capture rules-promotion-knight
